        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵamlamwile Aloni jwakutaga mbopesi nipo ŵakwesile Litumbi lya Holi. Ali akwesile ŵawilile kukoko ali ŵana yaka 123 pa lisiku lyandanda lya mwesi wa msano wa caka ca 40 Aisalaeli ali atyosile mcilambo ca Iguputo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
