        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'Ciŵata ca Mowabu ciŵandika ni Lusulo lwa Yolodani, kutyocela ku Yeliko AMBUJE ŵamsalile Mose kuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwasalile Aisalaeli kuti, pitajomboceje Lusulo lwa Yolodani kwinjila mcilambo ca Kenani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵatoposye ŵandu wosope ŵene ŵakutama mwelemo. Ajonanje maganga gosope gakusepa mitembe ja yisyano josope ni malo gawo gakulambilago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajinjile mcilambomo ni kutamagamo, ligongo une ngucipeleka kwa jemanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mcigaŵanye cilamboco mwa mitundu josope ni maŵele gosope pakutenda yisango, mpeleceje cilambo cacikulungwa kwa liŵasa lyalikulungwa nipo cilambo cacinondi kwa liŵasa lyalinondi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.54+NUM.26.55+NUM.26.56"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 26:54-56",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo naga ngamkwatoposya alukosyo ŵa mcilambowo, ŵawowo ŵitacisigalawo tacisanduka kwa jemanja ŵakusawusya kwakogoya mpela yisonga yakumsoma m'meso mwenu ni miŵa jakumsoma mumbali mwenu, nipo tacimenyana ni jemanja kwakogoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga ngamkwatoposya, une tinjimjonanga, mpela muningajonanjile jemanjajo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
